<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasAugmentation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instruct the AR training system to play or display the\n            augmentation with the target id provided (a predicate.id, primitive.id, or warning.id\n            from the workplace model or an action.id from the activity model)."@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasAugmentationType
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasAugmentationType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
