# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDetectables
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDetectables> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDetectables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#workplace> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDetectables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Detectables are entities that link to fiducial markers, target\n            feature models, or other sensor state properties providing input to the computer vision\n            system."@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevice
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#action> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "Specify on which device to execute the action"@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevices
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevices> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevices> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#workplace> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasDevices> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Devices are the AR hardware delivery systems that the AR\n            training system may communicate with to render the learning experience for the user."@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasEnter
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasEnter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasEnter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Container for augmentations that will be activated or\n            deactivated, and which messages and validation rules will be executed, once the action\n            step is launched"@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasExit
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasExit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasExit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Container for augmentations which will be activated or\n            deactivated, and which messages and validation rules will be executed, once the action\n            step is exited"@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLaunch
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLaunch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLaunch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#message> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLaunch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specify which action shall be launched on the recipient device\n            The AR training system shall publish launch ids to other devices or sensors on the MQTT\n            topic target + “/” + id."@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLocation
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#action> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "Refer to a particular place where the action happens"@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPersons
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPersons> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPersons> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#workplace> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPersons> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Persons refer to the people in the workplace with whom the user\n            may interact"@en .
# 
# https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPlaces
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPlaces> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPlaces> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.org/arlem-onto#workplace> .
<https://purl.org/arlem-onto#hasPlaces> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Places are tangibles. They refer to locations within the\n            workplace."@en .
